warning[redundant_alias]: `result` is returned right after it is declared
  --> tests/lint/redundant_alias/example.jai:4:5
   |
 4 |     result := n * n;
   |     ^^^^^^
   |
help: return the value directly
   |
 3   square :: (n: int) -> int {
 4 ~     return n * n;
 5 -     return result;
 6   }
   |
   = note: `redundant_alias` is `warn` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/redundant_alias
